'''Iz the Dancer of Grief''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] event. She was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]].

