==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]], this was an unobtainable unit that used [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]]'s sprites as placeholders.
*This unit has the most [[Special Abilities|abilities]] out of any Character in the game, with 17.
**Prior to her addition, this title was shared between [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Elder Mask Doron]] (before his True Form was added in 12.0) and [[Lasvoss (Uber Rare Cat)|Lasvoss Reborn]], with 12.
*In a previous update, the description incorrectly stated that Iz had [[Behemoth Slayer]] instead of Colossus Slayer.

